# Crash and Burn, second mode: "deals 6 damage to target creature or planeswalker" (CR 700.2, 120.3). Bot2 has a Wall of Earth (0/6), a Wall
# of Granite (0/7), and a Mox Pearl. On turn 3 the target question refuses Bot2 itself (a player is not a creature or planeswalker) and the
# Mox Pearl (an artifact, not a creature), then takes the Wall of Earth: 6 damage is lethal to toughness 6, it dies. On turn 5 the second
# Crash and Burn takes the Wall of Granite: 6 damage marked, not lethal to toughness 7, so it survives with exactly 6 (a damage of 5 or 7
# would fail the toughness-6 death or the Damage = 6).

